  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">As you parse your forbidden knowledge, you also have learned how to convert a regular forge into a soulforge. This act must often be conducted in secrecy or while providing as little information as possible, as passing this knowledge is likely an act that could break your pact from Curse of Secrecy. When you take this feat, you can construct a Soulforge (lesser) from a regular forge or similar facility. When you become a Master in crafting, you can construct a standard Soulforge, and when you become Legendary, you can construct a Soulforge (Greater), upgrading an existing Soulforge if you have access to a lesser one.</span></p>"
